#ASSERT `By when must I appeal to the appeal tribunal` FALSE `leave application` `any` TRUE (`d` 1 3 2027) TRUE FALSE (`d` 20 2 2027) `I made one within 28 days after getting written reasons, and it is not yet finally dealt with` `any` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `By when must I appeal to the appeal tribunal` TRUE `leave application` `any` TRUE (`d` 1 3 2027) TRUE FALSE (`d` 20 2 2027) `none made` `any` EQUALS NOTHING

#ASSERT `Am I in time to appeal to the appeal tribunal` FALSE `leave application` `any` TRUE (`d` 1 3 2027) TRUE FALSE (`d` 20 2 2027) `none made` `any` (`d` 29 3 2027) FALSE `any` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Am I in time to appeal to the appeal tribunal` FALSE `leave application` `any` TRUE (`d` 1 3 2027) TRUE FALSE (`d` 20 2 2027) `none made` `any` (`d` 30 3 2027) FALSE `any` EQUALS JUST FALSE
